online and I figure it goes out and Scoutmasters listen to it and maybe other Scout volunteers,

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:17,740
you know.

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,280
And this is wonderful.

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,720
It's a great thing.

7
